{"des":"与艾尔莎交谈","script":"m_1_1_2","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":10,"y":0,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara1"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]两位，逛了这么会儿，你们对驿站的第一印象如何？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]就还行吧！这地方到处都是人，确实有不少求生者草原上没有的乐子。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这里的人看上去充满了希望。","tag":"tag_7"},{"text":"我还以为驿站至少会是个大城镇。","tag":"tag_11"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[cm][show]你很有眼光嘛，这就是驿站最了不起的地方了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_46"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]在这个名为“深渊”的残酷荒原上，“[color=ffb64d]希望[colorEnd]”可是比“[color=ffb64d]生存[colorEnd]”还要奢侈的东西。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]在那场“[color=f1401c]大兽潮[colorEnd]”之后，也只有驿站这里还能保有一丁点希望的火种了，[r]这也是多亏了老板和契约者们的努力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"jump"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_50"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show][cm]它曾经是。在那场“[color=f1401c]大兽潮[colorEnd]”之后，曾经的驿站几乎片瓦不存。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_45"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]现在你眼前的这一大片聚居地，都是在几年之间，[r]由村民和[color=ffb64d]契约者[colorEnd]们一砖一瓦地重建起来的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]比起深渊的其它区域，秋日荒野的情况已经是最好的了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"jump"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好了，说正题吧。之前说的那个“契约者”到底是什么，我们要做些什么？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_40"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]那好，我就为两位简单介绍一下吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_39"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[cm][show]“契约者”规则，是深渊里的古老传统。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_47"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]要知道，即使在“人外的黄昏”之前，深渊也不是什么条件优越的居所。[r][l]艰苦生存的深渊住民们，一直秉承着等价交换的“契约精神”。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_41"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]而契约者就是这样一群人——他们与别人订立契约、遵守契约、完成契约，然后拿到报酬。正是有了契约和契约者的存在，深渊住民们才能在不断的天灾人祸之中，一直坚持到今天。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"听上去好像是冒险者或者佣兵之类的职业。","tag":"tag_42"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_42"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1c","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[cm][show]嗯～虽然是有些微小的区别，实际上也差不太多。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_43"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]而且现在的深渊，除了驿站之外，其他势力也不再组建任何契约者之类的编制了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]所以你要把契约者认为是从属于驿站的冒险者，其实也没什么问题。[r]至少管理宽松和来去自由这两点，和其他的冒险者公会应该是大差不离。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]一直以来，我们都很希望米托拉这样强大的荒野客能加入到契约者的大家庭中来，不过她始终不太感兴趣……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]不过现在，你们的营地因为角布林的袭击，突然变得一穷二白。[r][l]要不要干脆趁此机会，[color=ffb64d]当个契约者[colorEnd]试试呢？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_44"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]这样一来，驿站能够得到你们的帮助，你们也能获得[color=ffb64d]亟需的物资[colorEnd]。这样双赢，何乐而不为呢？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":150,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":150,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":150},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唔……和之前说的一样，真是个麻烦的要求。现在还加上趁人之危……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]事先说好啊，这个什么契约者，我可只会当到挣够钱，换够我需要的储备为止。[r][l]可不会永远陪你们玩下去！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_37"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]好的，这当然是你的自由——！那么就请容我为两位登记造册，请在这里按下手印！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"（依言按下）","tag":"tag_31"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-230,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"time":300,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","y":0,"d":0.8,"x":10},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"time":500,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_48"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]唔……这样就行了吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[cm][show]这样就可以了。按照流程，我要为两位提供一次伙伴募集协助。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"伙伴……募集？","tag":"tag_24"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]我才不要什么伙伴！我的伙伴有这家伙就足够了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]当然，你们的强大毋庸置疑。不过不同的契约总有难易之分，总有一些时候，我们会希望身边的战力越多越好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]这种时候就要借助伙伴的力量了——这些就是招募伙伴用的契约。请随意打开一卷吧。当然，是免费的！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_49"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":750,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":50,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"time":300,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}